==Battleground==
*10 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
*10 [[Glowstick Guys]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
*10 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
*10 [[Glowstick Guys]] spawn, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Glowstick Guys]] spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Master A.]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Dashing Face]]s spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
An easy stage that any unit can beat. Use any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

